      "statement": "The archive token is HMAC-SHA256 over 'v1:<name>:<tree>:<exp>' with a 300-second TTL; verify checks canonical name/tree, exact token grammar, the window now < exp <= now + ttl + 60 and a constant-time signature comparison, and every failure is the same False.",
